WEBVTT

00:14:27.537 --> 00:14:32.246
When I was doing my research on your
childhood and adolescence,

00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:38.912
they came across a couple of little facts
that really were wonderfully surprising.

00:14:39.537 --> 00:14:43.454
I know that when you were 13,
you moved to Aitkin County.

00:14:43.454 --> 00:14:46.746
It was very narrowly lived in a house
with your mom and your stepfather.

00:14:47.371 --> 00:14:50.537
They built the house and for many years
the house didn't have electricity

00:14:50.537 --> 00:14:54.537
or running water, didn't have indoor
plumbing until after you went to college.

00:14:55.037 --> 00:14:57.246
But despite all of this, Cheryl Strayed,

00:14:57.496 --> 00:15:00.579
you were a high school cheerleader
and the homecoming queen.